  "asserted_semantics": [
    "project_state is host file identity: path is the last opened/saved path (absent for untitled) and dirty compares the document to the last saved/opened fingerprint.",
    "save_project is staged, not executed inside the command: the transaction commits first and the host then saves through the atomic save path.",
    "An untitled project refuses the save request before commit (save), so no command half-applies.",
    "A save failure after commit is a warning event and the document stays dirty; the command is still reported as committed.",
    "A plugin cannot open, create or replace the active document; those remain interactive host operations."
  ],
